  "description": "Create, validate, embed, render and read ZUGFeRD and XRechnung e-invoices from C# and .NET. A thin, typed client for the InvoiceXML REST API: EN 16931 invoice model in, ZUGFeRD PDF/A-3 or XRechnung XML out, validated against the official rule sets before delivery. Rule sets are updated on their legal effective dates, with no package update needed.",
